data: {"id": "19d74636ad974ffe-thinking-parallel_evidence-1895", "run_id": "19d74636ad974ffe", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我看到问题的根源了。Pod 的事件显示：\n\n```\nWarning FailedMount Pod/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found\n```\n\n这表明 Pod 无法挂载 `input` 卷，因为 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。这就是 Pod 一直处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态的原因。\n\n让我验证一下这个 ConfigMap 是否真的不存在。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788420982298, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

