data: {"id": "19d74636ad974ffe-final", "run_id": "19d74636ad974ffe", "seq": 2237, "ts_ms": 1788421005645, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod spec 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 作为 volume `input` 挂载，导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败，Pod 一直处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-c88d660976d0` | `Warning FailedMount 2m35s (x48 over 84m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 证实挂载失败的具体原因：依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-0085f5e9a8ed` | `container.waiting_reason` = `ContainerCreating` | 确认容器处于等待阶段，因底层资源依赖未就绪阻塞 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `fact-032d8dd3521a` | `pod.phase` = `Pending` | 确认 Pod 整体处于待调度或等待就绪状态，未进入 Running |\n| 4 | Metric | `fact-bb93c5a3bd22` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1 | 通过 Prometheus 确认该状态持续存在（单样本） |\n| 5 | Metric | `fact-d7f9a94ad546` | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{container=\"app\"}` = 0 | 确认容器尚未启动，未发生过重启，排除 OOM/Kill 场景 |\n| 6 | Tool Output | `failed_tool_attempts` | `configmaps \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接验证了该 ConfigMap 在目标命名空间中确实不存在 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s 事件（#1）明确指出了挂载失败是由于 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 缺失，这直接解释了为什么容器（#2）一直处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态且 Pod 处于 `Pending`（#3）。Metric 数据（#4, #5）与 K8s 状态一致，确认了这一阻塞状态是持续的且未引发重启。工具验证（#6）进一步证实了该 ConfigMap 确实缺失，排除了临时网络或权限故障的可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` (K8s Config) → kubelet 挂载卷失败 (Event #1) → Pod 陷入 Pending/ContainerCreating (State #2, #3) → 业务不可用 (隐含现象)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的卷配置中引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该 ConfigMap 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n**证据支撑：**\n*   **K8s Event** 明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 导致 `MountVolume.SetUp failed`（证据 #1）。\n*   **K8s State** 和 **Metric** 确认由于挂载失败，Pod 持续处于 `Pending` / `ContainerCreating` 阶段，且未触发重启（证据 #2, #3, #4, #5）。\n*   **工具验证** 确认了该 ConfigMap 确实缺失（证据 #6）。\n\n因此，故障的直接原因是**配置引用了缺失的基础设施资源**，导致 Kubernetes 无法完成卷挂载，进而阻止容器启动。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 52.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 52.9s (Evidence 47.3s, RCA 5.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 81.102, "metrics": {"run_id": "19d74636ad974ffe", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 81.10906672477722, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 81109.06672477722, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 76644.73843574524, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9290.160179138184, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4009.0982913970947}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16963.97829055786, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 52916.420459747314, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11207.537412643433, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

